&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Implements statistical programming aspects of the protocol and the clinical development program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ensures high quality is built into own deliverables and the quality delivered by other programmers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Programs independently with high efficiency and quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Writes and/or implements specifications and oversees completeness of relevant documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development of best practices to improve quality, efficiency, and effectiveness within the function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ensures compliance with standards and automation usage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Plans and support team activities and tasks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Communicates and escalates risks within the assigned studies and/or projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Works proactively with study team members including but not limited to the Statistician, Lead Programmer, Data Manager and Study Leader.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
